const els={files:$('#files'),drop:$('#drop'),list:$('#mediaList'),loading:$('#loading'),loadBar:$('#loadBar'),loadPct:$('#loadPct'),loadText:$('#loadText'),empty:$('#empty'),screen:$('#screen'),sourceA:$('#sourceA'),sourceB:$('#sourceB'),video:$('#video'),videoB:$('#videoB'),gif:$('#gif'),gifB:$('#gifB'),layers:$('#layerPreview'),duration:$('#duration'),time:$('#time'),count:$('#clipCount'),ruler:$('#ruler'),vtrack:$('#videoTrack'),ttrack:$('#textTrack'),gtrack:$('#graphicTrack'),inner:$('#timelineInner'),playhead:$('#playhead'),inspector:$('#inspector'),inspectorTitle:$('#inspectorTitle'),drawer:$('#drawer'),renderProgress:$('#renderProgress'),renderText:$('#renderText'),renderPct:$('#renderPct'),renderBar:$('#renderBar'),renderBtn:$('#renderBtn'),summary:$('#exportSummary'),previewMsg:$('#previewMsg'),exportPreview:$('#exportPreview'),exportPreviewGif:$('#exportPreviewGif'),mediaView:$('#mediaView'),shapeView:$('#shapeView'),transitionView:$('#transitionView'),giphyView:$('#giphyView'),giphyResults:$('#giphyResults'),rangeShade:$('#rangeShade'),rangeInMarker:$('#rangeInMarker'),rangeOutMarker:$('#rangeOutMarker'),rangeLabel:$('#rangeLabel'),transformBox:$('#transformBox'),zoomValue:$('#zoomValue')};

const clipLen=c=>Math.max(.05,c.out-c.in);
function transitionOverlap(i){const a=state.clips[i],b=state.clips[i+1];if(!a||!b||a.transition==='cut')return 0;return Math.min(Math.max(.05,a.transitionDuration||.5),clipLen(a)*.45,clipLen(b)*.45)}
function total(){let n=state.clips.reduce((sum,c)=>sum+clipLen(c),0);for(let i=0;i<state.clips.length-1;i++)n-=transitionOverlap(i);return Math.max(0,n)}
function startOf(i){let n=0;for(let x=0;x<i;x++)n+=clipLen(state.clips[x])-transitionOverlap(x);return n}
function previewAt(t){for(let i=0;i<state.clips.length;i++){const c=state.clips[i],start=startOf(i),len=clipLen(c),end=start+len,ov=transitionOverlap(i);if(t>=start-.001&&t<=end+.001){const primary={clip:c,index:i,local:clamp(t-start,0,len),start};if(ov>0&&t>=end-ov&&state.clips[i+1]){const next=state.clips[i+1],alpha=clamp((t-(end-ov))/ov,0,1);return{primary,secondary:{clip:next,index:i+1,local:clamp(t-(end-ov),0,clipLen(next)),start:end-ov},alpha}}return{primary,secondary:null,alpha:0}}}return null}
function toast(m,type=''){const e=$('#toast');e.textContent=m;e.dataset.type=type;e.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toast.t);toast.t=setTimeout(()=>e.classList.remove('show'),2500)}
async function gifMetadata(file){try{const x=new Uint8Array(await file.arrayBuffer());if(x.length<10)return{duration:5,width:0,height:0,kind:'gif'};const width=x[6]|x[7]<<8,height=x[8]|x[9]<<8;let delay=0,frames=0;for(let i=0;i<x.length-7;i++){if(x[i]===0x21&&x[i+1]===0xF9&&x[i+2]===0x04){const d=x[i+4]|x[i+5]<<8;delay+=(d||10)/100;frames++}}return{duration:delay>0?delay:Math.max(1,frames/10),width,height,kind:'gif'}}catch{return{duration:5,width:0,height:0,kind:'gif'}}}
function metadata(file){if(file.type==='image/gif'||/\.gif$/i.test(file.name))return gifMetadata(file);return new Promise(resolve=>{const v=document.createElement('video'),u=URL.createObjectURL(file);v.preload='metadata';v.onloadedmetadata=()=>{resolve({duration:Number.isFinite(v.duration)?v.duration:5,width:v.videoWidth,height:v.videoHeight,kind:'video'});URL.revokeObjectURL(u)};v.onerror=()=>{resolve({duration:5,width:0,height:0,kind:'video'});URL.revokeObjectURL(u)};v.src=u})}
async function addFiles(list){const files=[...list].filter(f=>f.type.startsWith('video/')||f.type==='image/gif'||/\.(mp4|mov|m4v|webm|mkv|avi|mpeg|mpg|gif|flv|wmv|ts|mts|m2ts|3gp|ogv|vob)$/i.test(f.name));if(!files.length)return toast('No encontré videos compatibles.','warn');els.loading.classList.remove('hidden');for(let i=0;i<files.length;i++){const f=files[i];els.loadText.textContent=`Leyendo ${f.name}`;els.loadBar.style.width=`${i/files.length*100}%`;els.loadPct.textContent=`${Math.round(i/files.length*100)}%`;const m=await metadata(f);const d=Math.max(.1,m.duration||5);state.clips.push({id:uid('clip'),file:f,url:URL.createObjectURL(f),previewUrl:null,proxyStatus:m.width?'native':'unknown',name:f.name,kind:m.kind,duration:d,in:0,out:d,width:m.width||0,height:m.height||0,transition:'cut',transitionDuration:.5,x:50,y:50,scale:1,rotation:0,opacity:1})}els.loadBar.style.width='100%';els.loadPct.textContent='100%';setTimeout(()=>els.loading.classList.add('hidden'),500);if(!state.selected)state.selected={type:'clip',id:state.clips[0].id};render();seek(0)}
function addLayer(type){const d=Math.max(1,total());const o={id:uid('layer'),type,start:clamp(state.time,0,d),duration:Math.min(4,d),x:50,y:50,scale:1,rotation:0,opacity:1,color:'#ffffff'};if(type==='text')Object.assign(o,{text:'Texto',fontSize:64});if(type==='shape')Object.assign(o,{shape:'rect',width:35,height:22});if(type==='solid')Object.assign(o,{color:'#111318',width:100,height:100});state.layers.push(o);state.selected={type:'layer',id:o.id};render()}
function addShape(shape){const d=Math.max(1,total()),dims=shape==='line'?{width:40,height:2}:shape==='arrow'?{width:38,height:16}:shape==='triangle'||shape==='diamond'?{width:28,height:28}:{width:35,height:22},o={id:uid('layer'),type:'shape',shape,start:clamp(state.time,0,d),duration:Math.min(4,d),x:50,y:50,opacity:1,scale:1,rotation:0,color:'#ffffff',...dims};state.layers.push(o);state.selected={type:'layer',id:o.id};render()}
async function addGifLayer(file,name='GIPHY sticker'){if(!state.clips.length)return toast('Agrega primero un video base.','warn');const m=await gifMetadata(file),remaining=Math.max(.5,total()-state.time),o={id:uid('layer'),type:'gif',file,url:URL.createObjectURL(file),name,start:clamp(state.time,0,total()),duration:Math.min(4,remaining),x:50,y:50,width:28,scale:1,rotation:0,opacity:1,sourceWidth:m.width||480,sourceHeight:m.height||480};state.layers.push(o);state.selected={type:'layer',id:o.id};render();toast('GIF añadido como sticker.','ok')}
function sortedLayers(){const rank={solid:0,shape:1,gif:2,text:3};return state.layers.map((o,i)=>({o,i})).sort((a,b)=>(rank[a.o.type]??1)-(rank[b.o.type]??1)||a.i-b.i).map(x=>x.o)}
function render(){renderList();renderTimeline();renderInspector();renderMeta();renderLayers()}
function rangeOut(){return state.rangeOut==null?total():clamp(state.rangeOut,0,total())}
function rangeDuration(){return Math.max(0,rangeOut()-clamp(state.rangeIn,0,total()))}
function normalizeRange(){state.rangeIn=clamp(state.rangeIn||0,0,total());if(state.rangeOut!=null)state.rangeOut=clamp(state.rangeOut,state.rangeIn,total());if(state.rangeOut!=null&&state.rangeOut-state.rangeIn<.01)state.rangeOut=null}
function updateRangeUI(){normalizeRange();const d=Math.max(total(),.001),ri=state.rangeIn,ro=rangeOut(),active=ri>.001||state.rangeOut!=null;els.rangeShade.classList.toggle('hidden',!active);els.rangeInMarker.classList.toggle('hidden',!active);els.rangeOutMarker.classList.toggle('hidden',!active);if(active){const left=72+(ri/d)*Math.max(0,els.inner.clientWidth-72),right=72+(ro/d)*Math.max(0,els.inner.clientWidth-72);els.rangeShade.style.left=left+'px';els.rangeShade.style.width=Math.max(1,right-left)+'px';els.rangeInMarker.style.left=left+'px';els.rangeOutMarker.style.left=right+'px';els.rangeLabel.textContent=`${fmt(ri)} → ${fmt(ro)}`}else els.rangeLabel.textContent='Todo'}
function renderMeta(){normalizeRange();els.duration.textContent=fmt(total());els.time.textContent=fmt(state.time);els.count.textContent=state.clips.length?`${state.clips.length} clip${state.clips.length===1?'':'s'}`:'Sin clips';const activeRange=state.rangeIn>.001||state.rangeOut!=null;els.summary.textContent=activeRange?`${state.clips.length} clip${state.clips.length===1?'':'s'} · Rango ${fmt(state.rangeIn)} → ${fmt(rangeOut())} · ${fmt(rangeDuration())}`:`${state.clips.length} clip${state.clips.length===1?'':'s'} · ${fmt(total())}`;updateRangeUI()}
function renderList(){els.list.innerHTML=state.clips.length?state.clips.map((c,i)=>{const url=c.previewUrl||c.url,thumb=c.kind==='gif'&&!c.previewUrl?`<img class="media-thumb" src="${url}" alt="">`:`<video class="media-thumb" src="${url}" muted preload="metadata" playsinline></video>`;return`<button draggable="true" class="media-card ${state.selected?.type==='clip'&&state.selected.id===c.id?'selected':''}" data-clip="${c.id}"><span class="thumb-wrap">${thumb}<em>${fmt(clipLen(c))}</em></span><span class="media-name"><strong>${esc(c.name)}</strong><small>${c.width||'?'}×${c.height||'?'}${c.proxyStatus==='proxy'?' · proxy':''}</small></span></button>`}).join(''):'<p class="muted centertext">Los clips aparecerán aquí.</p>'}
function renderTimeline(){const d=Math.max(1,total()),z=Number($('#zoom').value)/100,viewport=Math.max(760,$('#timelineScroll').clientWidth||760),w=Math.max(viewport,d*90*z);els.inner.style.width=`${w}px`;els.zoomValue.textContent=`${Math.round(z*100)}%`;let ticks='';const step=d>120?10:d>60?5:d>20?2:1;for(let t=0;t<=Math.ceil(d);t+=step)ticks+=`<span style="left:${t/d*100}%">${fmt(t)}</span>`;els.ruler.innerHTML=ticks;els.vtrack.innerHTML=state.clips.map((c,i)=>{const len=clipLen(c),left=startOf(i)/d*100,width=len/d*100,tag=c.transition==='cut'?'':`<i>${c.transition==='crossfade'?'mix':c.transition==='fadeblack'?'black':'white'} ${(transitionOverlap(i)||0).toFixed(1)}s</i>`;return`<button draggable="true" data-clip="${c.id}" class="timeline-item video-item ${state.selected?.type==='clip'&&state.selected.id===c.id?'selected':''}" style="left:${left}%;width:${Math.max(1,width)}%;z-index:${i+1}"><span class="trim-handle trim-left" data-trim="in"></span><b>${i+1}</b><span>${esc(c.name)}</span>${tag}<span class="trim-handle trim-right" data-trim="out"></span>${i<state.clips.length-1?`<span class="transition-slot ${c.transition!=='cut'?'active':''}" data-transition-index="${i}" title="Suelta una transición aquí">⋈</span>`:''}</button>`}).join('');const lane=(arr)=>arr.map(o=>`<button data-layer="${o.id}" class="timeline-item layer-item ${state.selected?.type==='layer'&&state.selected.id===o.id?'selected':''}" style="left:${o.start/d*100}%;width:${Math.max(1.5,o.duration/d*100)}%"><span class="layer-edge layer-left" data-layer-edge="start"></span><b>${o.type==='text'?'T':o.type==='solid'?'■':o.type==='gif'?'GIF':'□'}</b><span>${esc(o.type==='text'?o.text:o.type==='solid'?'Sólido':o.type==='gif'?(o.name||'GIF'):'Forma')}</span><span class="layer-edge layer-right" data-layer-edge="end"></span></button>`).join('');els.ttrack.innerHTML=lane(state.layers.filter(o=>o.type==='text'));els.gtrack.innerHTML=lane(state.layers.filter(o=>o.type!=='text'));updatePlayhead();updateRangeUI()}
function updatePlayhead(){els.playhead.style.left=`calc(72px + (100% - 72px) * ${clamp(state.time/Math.max(total(),1),0,1)})`;els.time.textContent=fmt(state.time);renderLayers()}
